<title>GERMANY: Metro takes over PC retailer Peacock.</title>
<headline>Metro takes over PC retailer Peacock.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retail group Metro AG said on Tuesday its Vobis Microcomputer AG unit would take over rival PC retailer Peacock AG.</p>
<p>Vobis would also take over Peacock Systeme GmbH, Metro said in a statement.</p>
